# Moses — the Slack tokens. The ONLY secrets Moses needs. Copy OUTSIDE this repo:
#   install -m 600 config/slack.env.example ~/.config/moses/slack.env
#
# From api.slack.com/apps → your app. Socket Mode on, with an app-level token (xapp-…). The bot token
# (xoxb-…) needs: chat:write, chat:write.customize, commands, app_mentions:read, channels:history,
# groups:history, channels:read, groups:read, im:history, files:write, reactions:write, reactions:read.
# agent/verify-slack-scopes.sh exercises every path and says which scope is missing.
#
# NOTHING IN HERE BELONGS IN GIT. `.gitignore` refuses *.env, and tools/scan-secrets.sh refuses
# anything token-shaped at commit time. Both, because one of them is only a convention.
SLACK_BOT_TOKEN=
SLACK_APP_TOKEN=
